        "en": "Most reviewers praise Dr. Estes, Dr. Ainsley, and the clinic technicians for their warmth, patience, and empathetic bedside manner. Pet owners frequently note that staff take time to answer questions and provide comforting support during difficult end-of-life decisions. One client, however, felt the team was disorganized during administrative handovers."
