        "en": "Pet parents report positive clinical outcomes for chronic condition management, ear infection treatments, and routine spay or neuter surgeries. Clients appreciate thorough examinations and clear home care guidance that helped companion animals recover comfortably. While one reviewer experienced lost laboratory records, most express high confidence in medical care."
